Pasal 15
(1) Struktur organisasi PPT sebagaimana dimaksud dalam Pasal  14 terdiri dari:
a. Ketua;
b. Wakil Ketua;
c. Sekretaris; dan
d. Anggota.
(2) Bidang–bidang dalam struktur organisasi PPT sekurang kurangnya meliputi :
a. bidang layanan pengaduan;
b. bidang layanan kesehatan;
c. bidang layanan bantuan hukum dan penegakan hukum; d. bidang layanan rehabilitasi sosial; dan
e. bidang pemulangan dan reintegrasi sosial.

translated_text:
Article 15
(1) The organizational structure of PPT as referred to in Article 14 consists of:
a. Chairperson;
b. Vice Chairperson;
c. Secretary; and
d. Members.
(2) The fields within the organizational structure of PPT at minimum include:
a. complaint service field;
b. health service field;
c. legal aid and law enforcement service field; d. social rehabilitation service field; and
e. repatriation and social reintegration field.

Article 17
The health service sector as referred to in Article 15 paragraph (2) letter b has the following duties:
a. to conduct examination, treatment, and follow-up care for victims
b. to coordinate the implementation of health rehabilitation and medicolegal;
c. to conduct medicolegal examination including collection of evidence from victims and preparation of visum et repertum;
d. to conduct supporting and laboratory examinations of evidence;
e. to conduct consultation with specialist doctors or make referrals; and
f. to prepare case reports.

text:
BAB X
PARTISIPASI MASYARAKAT
Pasal 25
(1) Masyarakat ikut berpartisipasi dalam penyelenggaraan  perlindungan terhadap korban.
(2) Partisipasi masyarakat sebagaimana dimaksud pada ayat (1)  berupa :
a. memberikan perlindungan bagi korban;
b. memberikan pertolongan darurat;
c. memberikan advokasi terhadap korban dan atau  masyarakat tentang penanganan kasus kekerasan  berbasis gender dan anak;
d. membantu proses pengajuan permohonan penetapan  perlindungan;
e. menyampaikan informasi kepada aparat yang berwenang  terkait dengan kasus kekerasan berbasis gender dan  anak;
f. menyelenggarakan penguatan kelompok-kelompok  masyarakat dalam penanganan kekerasan berbasis  gender dan anak; dan
g. menyebarluaskan informasi tentang peraturan  perundang-undangan yang berkaitan dengan kekerasan  berbasis gender dan anak.

translated_text:
CHAPTER X
COMMUNITY PARTICIPATION
Article 25
(1) The community participates in the implementation of protection for victims.
(2) Community participation as referred to in paragraph (1) shall be in the form of:
a. providing protection for victims;
b. providing emergency assistance;
c. providing advocacy to victims and or the community regarding the handling of gender-based and child violence cases;
d. assisting in the process of submitting applications for protection orders;
e. conveying information to the authorized authorities related to gender-based and child violence cases;
f. organizing the strengthening of community groups in handling gender-based and child violence; and
g. disseminating information about laws and regulations related to gender-based and child violence.
